   "text": "Operator in the Demo Console. 7.3 reads\nCost Management, the budget and the\ntoken meter. 7.4 lowers\nabw-agent-token-quota or abw-agent-rpm\nfor about a minute, then restores them\n(global: demo tenant only).",
