   "text": "Azure Cost Management: ActualCost, month to date,\nby service, for the resource group. Data arrives\nhours late; no dollars in the workbook.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "d11_0152",
   "originalText": "Azure Cost Management: ActualCost, month to date,\nby service, for the resource group. Data arrives\nhours late; no dollars in the workbook.",
