   "text": "Log Analytics workspace\nlog-abw-demo-<region>-001. AppMetrics holds\nthe token metric (through Application Insights);\nApiManagementGatewayLogs holds the\nabw-gateway trace.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "d11_0158",
   "originalText": "Log Analytics workspace\nlog-abw-demo-<region>-001. AppMetrics holds\nthe token metric (through Application Insights);\nApiManagementGatewayLogs holds the\nabw-gateway trace.",
   "autoResize": true,
