  },
  {
   "id": "d11_0176",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 966.0,
   "y": 1588.0,
   "width": 664.26,
   "height": 120.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp11_003"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2493777,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 18432447,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. The caller sends a Responses API request to APIM /agents with T1.\n2. APIM runs checks a to e in order. The first failure returns the red refusal on its row (a JSON\n    body with a request_id) and is logged. If all pass, APIM forwards to the Foundry project\n    endpoint with the token unchanged.\n3. Foundry authorises the person, runs the agent and, for a tool, sends the user's own token\n    T2b to the MCP API on the same APIM.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1. The caller sends a Responses API request to APIM /agents with T1.\n2. APIM runs checks a to e in order. The first failure returns the red refusal on its row (a JSON\n    body with a request_id) and is logged. If all pass, APIM forwards to the Foundry project\n    endpoint with the token unchanged.\n3. Foundry authorises the person, runs the agent and, for a tool, sends the user's own token\n    T2b to the MCP API on the same APIM.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d11_0177",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1659.0,
   "y": 1588.0,
   "width": 632.34,
   "height": 100.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp11_003"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2501696,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 18537176,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "4. The tool call crosses Wall 1 (APIM), Wall 2 (MCP server) and Wall 3 (data plane), as in\n    diagrams 03 and 05.\n5. The answer returns through Foundry and APIM; the front door adds the token headers.\n6. The meters flow to Application Insights and Log Analytics; the KQL functions and the\n    workbook tab read them.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "4. The tool call crosses Wall 1 (APIM), Wall 2 (MCP server) and Wall 3 (data plane), as in\n    diagrams 03 and 05.\n5. The answer returns through Foundry and APIM; the front door adds the token headers.\n6. The meters flow to Application Insights and Log Analytics; the KQL functions and the\n    workbook tab read them.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
